DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM SIGGRAPH Annual Conference\nWebsite: http
 s://s2027.siggraph.org/\nSource URL: https://s2026.siggraph.org/program/t
 echnical-papers/\nLocation: Anaheim\, California\, USA\nTopics: Computer 
 Graphics & Visualization\, Machine Learning\, Computer Vision & Pattern R
 ecognition\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Technical papers / conference and
  ACM TOG tracks\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNo
 tes: ACM SIGGRAPH confirms Anaheim\, August 8-12\, 2027. The technical-pa
 per schedule remains an annual proxy from the 2026 CFP's explicit 22:00 U
