 APH\, not SIGGRAPH Asia\; ranks refer to the conference series\, not the 
 TOG journal. XXL is an editorial estimate for the overall conference and 
 exhibition.\nScope: Computer graphics and interactive techniques\, center
 ed on rendering\, geometric modeling\, animation\, physical simulation\, 
 imaging\, visualization\, and immersive visual experiences. Generative AI
  and machine learning are relevant when they advance visual computing\, s
 uch as neural rendering and learned animation. Technical papers use integ
 rated conference and ACM TOG journal tracks\; this profile does not descr
 ibe SIGGRAPH Asia or all of AI.\nAdditional topics: Deep Representation L
 earning\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nScope sources (2026): https:
